-- V37: owner-approved Safari catalog revision, part 2, 2026-10-25.
-- DML stays outside jOOQ DDL simulation, like V17/V25/V36.
-- Forward-only: never rewrites booking, request, payment, capacity or cost snapshots.
-- Every content/fact edit is applied only when the stored value is the reviewed
-- baseline (or already the target); any other value aborts the whole revision.
